#. module: saas_demo
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_saas_demo
msgid ""
".. image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/license-AGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"   :target: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl\n"
"   :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
"\n"
"======================\n"
" Quick Demo Databases\n"
"======================\n"
"\n"
"One-click demo-instances with modules from your git repositories\n"
"\n"
"How it works\n"
"============\n"
"\n"
"* 1 ``saas.operator`` record has 1 set of repositories (``saas.demo`` record).\n"
"* In each repository only one branch is used.\n"
"* 1 ``saas.template`` record may have many ``saas.template.operator``. The idea\n"
"  is that we can rebuild template database on one operator, while there is\n"
"  another one available to use.\n"
"* ``saas.template`` records are generated automatically from ``saas.demo`` records\n"
"\n"
"Repository updating\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"* Once in a night all ``saas.demo`` 's *Operators* are marked for updates\n"
"* One by one *Operators* from ``saas.demo`` update repositories, destroy templates and start rebuilding templates.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"------------\n"
"* `Ivan Yelizariev <https://it-projects.info/team/yelizariev>`__\n"
"* `Denis Mudarisov <https://it-projects.info/team/mudarisov>`__\n"
"\n"
"Sponsors\n"
"--------\n"
"* `IT-Projects LLC <https://it-projects.info>`__\n"
"\n"
"Maintainers\n"
"-----------\n"
"* `IT-Projects LLC <https://it-projects.info>`__\n"
"\n"
"Further information\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"Demo: http://runbot.it-projects.info/demo/saas-addons/13.0\n"
"\n"
"HTML Description: https://apps.odoo.com/apps/modules/13.0/saas_demo/\n"
"\n"
"Usage instructions: `<doc/index.rst>`_\n"
"\n"
"Changelog: `<doc/changelog.rst>`_\n"
"\n"
"Notifications on updates: `via Atom <https://github.com/it-projects-llc/saas-addons/commits/13.0/saas_demo.atom>`_, `by Email <https://blogtrottr.com/?subscribe=https://github.com/it-projects-llc/saas-addons/commits/13.0/saas_demo.atom>`_\n"
"\n"
"Tested on Odoo 12.0 8d9e276a9fbf3b4cd8b8251e184d936ff654dd1f\n"
msgstr ""
".. image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/license-AGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"   :target: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl\n"
"   :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
"\n"
"============================================\n"
" Быстрое создание демонстрационных баз данных\n"
"============================================\n"
"\n"
"Демонстрационные экземпляры с модулями из ваших Git-репозиториев в один клик\n"
"\n"
"Как это работает\n"
"================\n"
"\n"
"* Одной записи ``saas.operator`` соответствует один набор репозиториев (запись ``saas.demo``).\n"
"* В каждом репозитории используется только одна ветка.\n"
"* Одной записи ``saas.template`` может соответствовать несколько записей ``saas.template.operator``. Это позволяет пересоздавать базу шаблона на одном операторе, пока другой остаётся доступным.\n"
"* Записи ``saas.template`` создаются автоматически на основе записей ``saas.demo``.\n"
"\n"
"Обновление репозиториев\n"
"=======================\n"
"\n"
"* Каждую ночь все *операторы* из ``saas.demo`` отмечаются для обновления.\n"
"* *Операторы* из ``saas.demo`` по очереди обновляют репозитории, удаляют шаблоны и запускают их пересоздание.\n"
"\n"
"Благодарности\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"Участники\n"
"---------\n"
"* `Ivan Yelizariev <https://it-projects.info/team/yelizariev>`__\n"
"* `Denis Mudarisov <https://it-projects.info/team/mudarisov>`__\n"
"\n"
"Спонсоры\n"
"--------\n"
"* `IT-Projects LLC <https://it-projects.info>`__\n"
"\n"
"Сопровождающие\n"
"--------------\n"
"* `IT-Projects LLC <https://it-projects.info>`__\n"
"\n"
"Дополнительная информация\n"
"=========================\n"
"\n"
"Демонстрация: http://runbot.it-projects.info/demo/saas-addons/13.0\n"
"\n"
"HTML-описание: https://apps.odoo.com/apps/modules/13.0/saas_demo/\n"
"\n"
"Инструкция по использованию: `<doc/index.rst>`_\n"
"\n"
"История изменений: `<doc/changelog.rst>`_\n"
"\n"
"Уведомления об обновлениях: `через Atom <https://github.com/it-projects-llc/saas-addons/commits/13.0/saas_demo.atom>`_, `по электронной почте <https://blogtrottr.com/?subscribe=https://github.com/it-projects-llc/saas-addons/commits/13.0/saas_demo.atom>`_\n"
"\n"
